---
import SketchLayout from '../../layouts/SketchLayout.astro';
---

<SketchLayout title="Sketch H — Fault line · Hozz" letter="H" name="Fault line">
  <main>
    <header class="masthead">
      <a class="wordmark" href="#proof">HOZZ</a>
      <p class="issue">Reliability note<br /><span>On interruption</span></p>
      <p class="status"><i></i> Early alpha · open source</p>
    </header>

    <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="thesis">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">An export is only as honest as its failure mode.</p>
        <h1 id="thesis">
          Interruption can<br />
          repeat work.<br />
          It cannot <em>skip.</em>
        </h1>
        <p class="lede">
          Hozz treats an export as a proof obligation, not a progress bar. If a
          phone pauses, expires, dies, or reboots, it resumes from the last
          durable checkpoint.
        </p>
      </div>

      <figure class="fault" aria-labelledby="fault-caption">
        <div class="fault-top">
          <p class="machine-label">In memory / not yet committed</p>
          <div class="loose-records" aria-hidden="true">
            <span>heartRate · 2c7a</span>
            <span>stepCount · 8f31</span>
            <span>sleepAnalysis · 93bd</span>
            <span>bodyMass · 67aa</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="cut" aria-hidden="true">
          <span>INTERRUPTION</span>
          <b>×</b>
          <span>BACKGROUND / KILL / REBOOT</span>
        </div>

        <div class="fault-bottom">
          <div class="seal">
            <span class="seal-kicker">Last durable checkpoint</span>
            <strong>ANCHOR<br />STAGED<br />SEALED</strong>
            <span class="seal-foot">One store transaction</span>
          </div>
          <div class="replay">
            <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">↳</span>
            <p><b>Restart:</b> discard the open part, read from the previous anchor, and safely repeat the work.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <figcaption id="fault-caption">
          The cut is deliberate: data above it was never allowed to move the
          cursor. There is nothing to guess after a failure.
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
    </section>

    <section class="proof" id="proof" aria-labelledby="proof-title">
      <div class="proof-intro">
        <p class="eyebrow">The durable path</p>
        <h2 id="proof-title">No timestamp is trusted to remember the boundary.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="proof-notes">
        <article>
          <span class="mark mark-anchor" aria-hidden="true">A</span>
          <h3>Anchor, not a date window</h3>
          <p>Each HealthKit type drains through <code>HKAnchoredObjectQuery</code> with its own opaque, device-local anchor.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <span class="mark mark-spool" aria-hidden="true">↯</span>
          <h3>Spool, then advance</h3>
          <p>Records stream to an NDJSON spool. The anchor advances only when its part is sealed in that same transaction.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <span class="mark mark-key" aria-hidden="true">K</span>
          <h3>Retry without fear</h3>
          <p>Stable content-derived identifiers and <code>Idempotency-Key</code> headers make a repeat safe for a receiver too.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="closing">
      <p><b>475 XCTest tests</b> exercise anchors, cancellation, retries, tombstones, deterministic encoding, delivery, and privacy invariants.</p>
      <p>Same records. Byte-identical output. Any locale. Any time zone.</p>
    </footer>
  </main>
</SketchLayout>

<style>
  @font-face {
    font-family: 'Cabinet';
    src: url('/fonts/CabinetGrotesk-Variable.woff2') format('woff2');
    font-weight: 100 900;
    font-style: normal;
    font-display: swap;
  }

  :global(body) {
    --ink: #101b29;
    --blue: #284ccf;
    --blue-deep: #15328d;
    --pale: #e6edf1;
    --paper: #f8faf9;
    --signal: #aa3044;
    --line: #aebbc4;
    background: var(--pale);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: var(--sans);
  }

  main {
    overflow: hidden;
    padding-bottom: 7rem;
  }

  .masthead,
  .hero,
  .proof,
  .closing {
    width: min(100% - clamp(2.25rem, 8vw, 9rem), 1340px);
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .masthead {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr;
    align-items: start;
    padding-top: clamp(1.35rem, 2.5vw, 2.5rem);
    font: 500 0.68rem/1.25 var(--mono);
    letter-spacing: 0.07em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .wordmark {
    color: var(--ink);
    font: 800 clamp(1rem, 1.5vw, 1.25rem)/1 Cabinet, var(--sans);
    letter-spacing: -0.08em;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .issue {
    margin: 0;
    color: #40505f;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .issue span {
    color: #526272;
  }

  .status {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    margin: 0;
    color: #40505f;
    text-align: right;
  }

  .status i {
    width: 0.45rem;
    height: 0.45rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--blue);
  }

  .hero {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.87fr) minmax(0, 1.13fr);
    gap: clamp(2.5rem, 7vw, 8rem);
    align-items: center;
    min-height: min(730px, calc(100svh - 4rem));
    padding-block: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 8.5rem) clamp(4.5rem, 8vw, 8rem);
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    color: var(--blue-deep);
    font: 500 0.72rem/1.3 var(--mono);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  h1,
  h2,
  h3,
  p {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  h1,
  h2,
  h3 {
    font-family: Cabinet, var(--sans);
  }

  h1 {
    max-width: 10ch;
    margin-bottom: 1.7rem;
    font-size: clamp(3.35rem, 3vw + 2.3rem, 6.4rem);
    font-weight: 720;
    line-height: 0.87;
    letter-spacing: -0.072em;
  }

  h1 em {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.02em 0.12em 0.1em 0.06em;
    color: #fff;
    background: var(--blue);
    font-style: normal;
    transform: rotate(-2deg);
  }

  .lede {
    max-width: 39ch;
    margin: 0;
    color: #283745;
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 0.93rem + 0.25vw, 1.19rem);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .fault {
    position: relative;
    margin: 0;
    padding: clamp(1rem, 2.5vw, 2rem);
    color: #e8effb;
    background: #152a4a;
    box-shadow: 16px 16px 0 #c8d6df;
  }

  .fault::before,
  .fault::after {
    position: absolute;
    z-index: 0;
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    content: '';
    background: var(--pale);
  }

  .fault::before { top: 0; right: 0; }
  .fault::after { bottom: 0; left: 0; }

  .fault-top,
  .fault-bottom,
  .cut,
  figcaption {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .machine-label,
  .seal-kicker,
  .seal-foot,
  figcaption {
    font: 500 0.65rem/1.3 var(--mono);
    letter-spacing: 0.075em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .machine-label {
    margin: 0 0 1.1rem;
    color: #9eb3d4;
  }

  .loose-records {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.42rem;
  }

  .loose-records span {
    display: block;
    width: max-content;
    max-width: 100%;
    padding: 0.55rem 0.7rem;
    overflow: hidden;
    color: #c7d5ec;
    font: 400 clamp(0.68rem, 0.6rem + 0.25vw, 0.82rem)/1.15 var(--mono);
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
    white-space: nowrap;
    border: 1px dashed #6981aa;
    transform: rotate(-0.8deg);
  }

  .loose-records span:nth-child(2) { transform: translateX(7%) rotate(0.8deg); }
  .loose-records span:nth-child(3) { transform: translateX(3%) rotate(-0.3deg); }
  .loose-records span:nth-child(4) { transform: translateX(10%) rotate(1.1deg); }

  .cut {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    margin: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 3rem) -0.35rem;
    color: #ffc6c9;
    font: 500 0.55rem/1.15 var(--mono);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .cut::before,
  .cut::after {
    height: 2px;
    content: '';
    background: repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, var(--signal) 0 8px, transparent 8px 13px);
  }

  .cut b {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 1.7rem;
    height: 1.7rem;
    color: #fff;
    background: var(--signal);
    border-radius: 50%;
    font: 400 1.45rem/1 var(--sans);
  }

  .cut span:last-child {
    position: absolute;
    right: 0;
    bottom: -1.1rem;
    color: #d58c97;
    font-size: 0.5rem;
  }

  .fault-bottom {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(8rem, 0.8fr) 1fr;
    gap: clamp(1.5rem, 3.5vw, 4rem);
    align-items: end;
    margin-top: 2.7rem;
  }

  .seal {
    padding: 0.8rem;
    color: #152a4a;
    background: #e1eafe;
    transform: rotate(-1.5deg);
  }

  .seal-kicker,
  .seal-foot {
    display: block;
    color: #355177;
    font-size: 0.51rem;
  }

  .seal strong {
    display: block;
    margin-block: 1.4rem 1.15rem;
    font: 800 clamp(1.2rem, 1rem + 0.8vw, 2rem)/0.84 Cabinet, var(--sans);
    letter-spacing: -0.06em;
  }

  .replay {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    padding-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .arrow {
    color: #86a6e2;
    font: 400 2.75rem/0.75 Cabinet, sans-serif;
  }

  .replay p {
    margin: 0;
    color: #d0dcf2;
    font-size: clamp(0.83rem, 0.77rem + 0.22vw, 0.98rem);
    line-height: 1.42;
  }

  figcaption {
    max-width: 48ch;
    margin-top: clamp(2.1rem, 4vw, 4rem);
    color: #91a7cb;
    font-size: 0.59rem;
  }

  .proof {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.72fr) minmax(0, 1.28fr);
    gap: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 10rem);
    padding-block: clamp(5rem, 10vw, 10rem);
  }

  h2 {
    max-width: 9ch;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(2.3rem, 2.2vw + 1.2rem, 4.5rem);
    font-weight: 680;
    line-height: 0.95;
    letter-spacing: -0.065em;
  }

  .proof-notes {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0;
  }

  .proof-notes article {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 2.8rem 1fr;
    column-gap: 1rem;
    padding-block: 1.35rem;
    border-top: 1px solid #aab9c4;
  }

  .proof-notes article:last-child {
    border-bottom: 1px solid #aab9c4;
  }

  .mark {
    grid-row: span 2;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 2.15rem;
    height: 2.15rem;
    color: #fff;
    background: var(--blue);
    font: 600 0.75rem/1 var(--mono);
  }

  .mark-spool { background: var(--signal); font-size: 1.3rem; }
  .mark-key { background: #315f81; }

  h3 {
    margin: 0 0 0.28rem;
    font-size: clamp(1.18rem, 1rem + 0.4vw, 1.5rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.045em;
  }

  .proof-notes p {
    max-width: 57ch;
    margin: 0;
    color: #3a4a58;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    line-height: 1.48;
  }

  code {
    color: #1d386a;
    font: 500 0.83em/1.35 var(--mono);
  }

  .closing {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 0.85fr;
    gap: clamp(2rem, 8vw, 8rem);
    padding: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
    color: #e7eefc;
    background: var(--blue);
  }

  .closing p {
    max-width: 51ch;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(0.93rem, 0.84rem + 0.24vw, 1.08rem);
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  .closing p:last-child {
    color: #c9d8ff;
    font: 500 clamp(0.72rem, 0.65rem + 0.18vw, 0.87rem)/1.45 var(--mono);
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  :global(a:focus-visible) {
    outline: 3px solid var(--signal);
    outline-offset: 5px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .masthead {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
    }

    .issue {
      display: none;
    }

    .hero,
    .proof,
    .closing {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .hero {
      min-height: 0;
      gap: 2.25rem;
      padding-block: 4.4rem 5.5rem;
    }

    .fault {
      width: calc(100% - 0.8rem);
      margin-left: 0;
      padding: 0.9rem;
      box-shadow: 10px 10px 0 #c8d6df;
    }

    .loose-records {
      gap: 0.32rem;
    }

    .loose-records span {
      padding: 0.43rem 0.58rem;
    }

    .cut {
      margin-block: 1.35rem;
    }

    .fault-bottom {
      margin-top: 1.9rem;
    }

    .seal strong {
      margin-block: 1.05rem 0.85rem;
    }

    figcaption {
      margin-top: 1.25rem;
    }

    .proof {
      gap: 2.5rem;
    }

    h2 {
      max-width: 13ch;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 430px) {
    .masthead,
    .hero,
    .proof,
    .closing {
      width: min(100% - 2rem, 1340px);
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(3.05rem, 15vw, 4rem);
    }

    .fault {
      padding: 1rem;
    }

    .cut {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
      margin-inline: 0;
      text-align: left;
    }

    .cut > span:first-child {
      display: none;
    }

    .cut::before {
      display: none;
    }

    .cut::after {
      order: -1;
    }

    .fault-bottom {
      grid-template-columns: 0.78fr 1fr;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .replay {
      gap: 0.4rem;
    }

    .arrow {
      font-size: 2rem;
    }

    .replay p {
      font-size: 0.78rem;
    }

    .proof-notes article {
      grid-template-columns: 2.5rem 1fr;
      column-gap: 0.65rem;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    *,
    *::before,
    *::after {
      scroll-behavior: auto !important;
      transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;
      animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;
      animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;
    }
  }
</style>
